window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"yasuo","b":"locke","win":["Yasuo","Yasuo","Yasuo","Yasuo","Yasuo","Yasuo","Yasuo"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"Wind Wall plus your flow shield blank his Q Ritual Nails poke, and E Sweeping Blade spacing means you trade on your terms every wave - his W self-damage does the rest."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Purgatory is a thrown projectile - Wind Wall eats it outright, and if it lands it grounds you, so your E and Q dashes are gone. Wall it, then all-in off any Q3."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Your crit spike arrives first and hardest - double-crit autos burst him faster than his W Soul Ignition window can answer."},{"when":"Late","text":"Wind Wall deletes his poke game in every fight and your crit scaling means he never survives long enough for execute math to matter."}],"wants":{"you":["Wind Wall his Q volleys and his R throw","E dash spacing that denies his trade pattern","A Q3 knockup into R during his W commit"],"foe":["Nails landed around your Wind Wall angles","Punishing your E-in with W Soul Ignition burst","R Purgatory landing to ground your dashes"]},"early":"Levels 1-3 he cannot touch you: the flow shield eats his opening poke, Wind Wall blanks entire Q Ritual Nails volleys, and E Sweeping Blade through minions lets you start and end trades at will while his W Soul Ignition burns his own health for damage you dodge - stack Q stacks and bully.","mid":"Levels 4-6 stay yours as flow shield plus mobility beat his grey-health commit pattern, and at 6 the kill script writes itself: any Q3 or E-Q knockup chains into Last Breath, which juggles him straight through his R Purgatory timing - his totem cannot save a target that is airborne when it matters.","late":"First crit item spikes your autos past anything his W burst window answers, and from there the fight is unfair: Wind Wall erases his poke in every skirmish, double-crit DPS deletes his squishy frame in two rotations, and his execute totem never fires because he is dead before the threshold check.","whys":["Wind Wall and your passive shield blank his level-1 Q poke.","At 2 the flow shield plus E spacing out-trades his Ritual Nails.","Level 3 double-Q into E dash trades free through his W self-damage.","Levels 4-5 flow shield and mobility beat his grey-health commit.","Level 6 Last Breath off a knockup juggles him and nullifies his R totem.","His Lich Bane lands before your crit item; it is even here.","Sustained crit plus Wind Wall shuts down his poke and execute late."]});
