window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"yasuo","b":"masteryi","win":["Yasuo","Yasuo","Skill","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi","Yasuo"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-2","text":"Q poke and E dash mobility beat his bare kit - harass every last-hit attempt and stack tornado threat before his resets exist."},{"when":"Lvl 5-6","text":"Alpha Strike (20s, shortened by his autos) goes untargetable through your Last Breath - hold R until it is spent, and shorten trades once Wuju Style is up."},{"when":"1st item","text":"His sustained DPS burns your Flow shield before your burst finishes, and Meditate (10s) refunds it - buy Executioner's before you commit."},{"when":"Late","text":"Your crit scaling and mobility make you the safer duelist again - Wind Wall does nothing to his melee on-hit, so land the tornado as he lands Alpha Strike."}],"wants":{"you":["Early Q harass before his engine ramps","Knockups landed as he exits Alpha Strike","Late crit fights where your wall wins"],"foe":["Meditate stalling into item spikes","Alpha Strike timed on your tornado throw","Mid-game duels while his DPS peaks"]},"early":"Levels 1-2 are yours to script: Steel Tempest poke taxes every last-hit and E Sweeping Blade lets you slide in, trade, and slide out before his single Alpha Strike answers - chip him relentlessly, because level 3 onward his resets arrive and the free-harass era closes for good.","mid":"Levels 3-5 tighten into a skill fight and then tip against you: Wuju Style adds true damage so armour will not save you, and Meditate (10s) heals through your chip - Executioner's makes extended trades work. A smart Yi holds Alpha Strike for your Q3 release; trade short and leave.","late":"Late game your crit scaling and mobility reclaim the duel: Wind Wall stops nothing of his melee on-hit, a landed tornado into Last Breath deletes his squishy frame and cancels a Meditate channel outright, and your dash tempo means you pick the fight's start and end - just never miss the knockup.","whys":["Q poke and E mobility beat his bare level-1 kit.","At 2 your dash-poke pattern out-harasses his single Alpha Strike.","Level 3 evens out as his resets and second point come online.","Levels 4-5 stay skill-decided while his attack speed ramps.","At 6 Highlander's attack speed and Wuju Style true damage beat your Flow shield.","First item favors him - Wuju Style's true damage ignores the armour you built.","Late, your crit scaling and mobility make you the safer duelist again."]});
